# Defaults

- Follow the repository's own instructions (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, contributing docs) over these.
- Match existing conventions, package manager, and scripts before introducing new ones.
- Keep changes focused on the request and say which checks you ran.
- Ask before running anything that changes external systems.
